\item[S2] Chris Lambie-Hanson and Assaf Rinot, \emph{A forcing axiom deciding the generalized Souslin hypothesis}, arXiv:1708.06932v2 (2018). Section1.1, page1 and footnote1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1708.06932}.
